{"identifier":"Personal1950","title":"Personal Hygiene (Part I)","description":"Military training drama showing how the residents of a barracks convince a sloppy soldier to clean up his act. With many folk songs on cleanliness.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/Personal1950/Personal1950_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/Personal1950","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/Personal1950","durationMs":895000,"level":"C1","topic":"Health and hygiene;Military;Music: Folk","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Personal Hygiene (Part I)","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":15001,"endMs":18000,"text":"It's the dawn of a new day."},{"startMs":19000,"endMs":20000,"text":"The world awakens."},{"startMs":22001,"endMs":27001,"text":"The birds twitter, a rooster crow."},{"startMs":30000,"endMs":35000,"text":"And soon as always will come that sound of music, sweet to the ears of all servicemen."},{"startMs":77000,"endMs":80000,"text":"The lulling strains of first call haven't sounded yet."},{"startMs":80001,"endMs":83000,"text":"So they're still sleeping peacefully."},{"startMs":84000,"endMs":85001,"text":"Well, some of them, that is."},{"startMs":87000,"endMs":89001,"text":"Mike Doyle here seems to be having trouble with his feet."},{"startMs":91000,"endMs":95001,"text":"Joe Kupicich must have eaten something that didn't agree with him, or with his stomach."},{"startMs":96000,"endMs":101001,"text":"Tom Davis sounds like a flour mill, but he's grinding his teeth."},{"startMs":102001,"endMs":104001,"text":"Wonder what's giving him bad dreams?"},{"startMs":105000,"endMs":108001,"text":"Was he too tired after that hike for his shower last night?"},{"startMs":110001,"endMs":120001,"text":"And looked at Homer Turner, well, he seems to be troubled from head to foot, with everything from galloping dandruff to creeping"},{"startMs":120001,"endMs":124000,"text":"epidermophytosis, and athlete's foot."},{"startMs":134001,"endMs":136001,"text":"Hey, what's cooking?"},{"startMs":143000,"endMs":146001,"text":"More trouble for Homer?"},{"startMs":170000,"endMs":170001,"text":"What's this?"},{"startMs":171000,"endMs":171001,"text":"Time to get out, fellas."},{"startMs":172000,"endMs":174000,"text":"Time to get out?"},{"startMs":175000,"endMs":176000,"text":"Where are you going?"},{"startMs":177000,"endMs":177001,"text":"Where are you going?"},{"startMs":177001,"endMs":179000,"text":"Where are you going?"},{"startMs":179000,"endMs":179001,"text":"Where's the matter?"},{"startMs":180000,"endMs":180001,"text":"Hey, hey, come on."},{"startMs":180001,"endMs":181000,"text":"Come on."},{"startMs":181000,"endMs":181001,"text":"Come on."},{"startMs":182000,"endMs":183001,"text":"Hey, hey, hey, fellas."},{"startMs":185001,"endMs":186001,"text":"Hey, let's go!"},{"startMs":215001,"endMs":217000,"text":"What's the big idea of ducking me in the creek?"},{"startMs":219000,"endMs":221000,"text":"Hey, what I want is, why did you do it?"},{"startMs":224000,"endMs":231000,"text":"Now's the time when a fella really needs a friend."},{"startMs":249001,"endMs":261001,"text":"Look down, look down, let alone some road"},{"startMs":261001,"endMs":269000,"text":"before the travels home."},{"startMs":272001,"endMs":279001,"text":"Look up, look up, and see your maker"},{"startMs":279001,"endMs":283001,"text":"who gave a deal."},{"startMs":283001,"endMs":284000,"text":"You want low, Homer?"},{"startMs":285000,"endMs":285001,"text":"Low."},{"startMs":286000,"endMs":288001,"text":"If I felt any lower, I'd be six feet underground."},{"startMs":289000,"endMs":291001,"text":"Maybe that's why even your best friends won't tell you."},{"startMs":292001,"endMs":294000,"text":"Are you trying to tell me that I smell?"},{"startMs":294001,"endMs":295001,"text":"Oh, no, Homer."},{"startMs":296000,"endMs":296001,"text":"I smell."},{"startMs":297000,"endMs":297001,"text":"You stink."},{"startMs":298000,"endMs":299000,"text":"Now you listen here."},{"startMs":299000,"endMs":300000,"text":"Now you listen to me."},{"startMs":300000,"endMs":301001,"text":"It's time you did more listening and less talking."},{"startMs":302000,"endMs":304001,"text":"It's time you found out why your own buddies hold their noses."},{"startMs":304001,"endMs":305000,"text":"What a fighting word."},{"startMs":306000,"endMs":308001,"text":"Maybe if you're in a fighting mood, you can do something about fixing up what's wrong with you."},{"startMs":308001,"endMs":309000,"text":"Like what?"},{"startMs":309000,"endMs":312000,"text":"Like taking a bath regularly, for instance, with soap and hot water."},{"startMs":312000,"endMs":313000,"text":"You're a soldier in the Army."},{"startMs":313000,"endMs":314000,"text":"I'm a good soldier."},{"startMs":314000,"endMs":317000,"text":"What good's a soldier if he spends most of his time in the hospital?"},{"startMs":317000,"endMs":318000,"text":"I'm not a gold brick."},{"startMs":319000,"endMs":320000,"text":"I haven't landed in the hospital yet."},{"startMs":320001,"endMs":321001,"text":"No, but you're going to."},{"startMs":324001,"endMs":327000,"text":"Homer, you know what germs are."},{"startMs":328001,"endMs":329001,"text":"They're little bugs."},{"startMs":329001,"endMs":330001,"text":"They're killer bugs."},{"startMs":330001,"endMs":331000,"text":"You want to know something?"},{"startMs":331001,"endMs":336000,"text":"In the last war, we often had more casualties from those little old bugs than we had from actual combat."},{"startMs":337000,"endMs":338001,"text":"[...] what do little bugs got to do with me?"},{"startMs":339000,"endMs":342001,"text":"Germs are all around you, billions of them, and on you too right now."},{"startMs":343001,"endMs":344001,"text":"The little bugs aren't going to harm me."},{"startMs":345001,"endMs":346001,"text":"You ever read this manual?"},{"startMs":348001,"endMs":349000,"text":"Oh, that's right."},{"startMs":349000,"endMs":349001,"text":"It's one."},{"startMs":351001,"endMs":353001,"text":"It's got too many long words in it."},{"startMs":354001,"endMs":356000,"text":"Too much book learning for me."},{"startMs":356000,"endMs":358000,"text":"Book learning's for soldiers too."},{"startMs":359000,"endMs":360000,"text":"I came across this."},{"startMs":361001,"endMs":374001,"text":"The term dermotypotilsis includes a group of infectious skin diseases caused by various fungi, microscopic moles, which rarely"},{"startMs":374001,"endMs":379001,"text":"penetrate deeper than the outer layer of the skin and may involve the herring nails."},{"startMs":380001,"endMs":387001,"text":"Ringworm, tinea, atelite feet, dermophytosis, trichostratus."},{"startMs":388001,"endMs":391000,"text":"How can you expect me to remember words I can't even pronounce?"},{"startMs":395001,"endMs":402001,"text":"We're a trudgeon, such a heavy..."},{"startMs":402001,"endMs":405001,"text":"Oh, but you can remember words from those folk songs you sing."},{"startMs":406001,"endMs":407000,"text":"Oh, them."},{"startMs":408000,"endMs":411000,"text":"Well, they've got rhyme and rhythm in reason."},{"startMs":413000,"endMs":413001,"text":"Look down."},{"startMs":415000,"endMs":416000,"text":"Look down."},{"startMs":418000,"endMs":420001,"text":"As long as you look."},{"startMs":422000,"endMs":428000,"text":"Yeah, it looks as though Homer is still quite a problem for Kelly and the other men in his barracks."},{"startMs":431000,"endMs":434001,"text":"Isn't that dunking business do the trick with Homer?"},{"startMs":435000,"endMs":436000,"text":"No, he wouldn't take the hint."},{"startMs":436001,"endMs":440000,"text":"Ah, you mean we have to keep on eating, living, and sleeping with hopeless Homer?"},{"startMs":440001,"endMs":441001,"text":"What about our barn dance?"},{"startMs":442000,"endMs":444001,"text":"If Homer's restricted, he can't play in our orchestra."},{"startMs":445000,"endMs":447000,"text":"It'll sound like mud without Homer's guitar."},{"startMs":447001,"endMs":450001,"text":"I've got my girl Myrtle all lined up for a date for the dance Saturday."},{"startMs":450001,"endMs":451000,"text":"Your girl?"},{"startMs":451001,"endMs":452000,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":452001,"endMs":455000,"text":"Why, you lame-brained dumb-head. I found her, didn't I?"},{"startMs":455000,"endMs":457000,"text":"Yeah, and you lost her to me, see?"},{"startMs":457000,"endMs":460000,"text":"Hey, cut it out. We've got something more important. Homer."},{"startMs":460001,"endMs":462001,"text":"How are we going to get him off the restricted list?"},{"startMs":462001,"endMs":465000,"text":"He forgets everything he's told about keeping himself clean."},{"startMs":465000,"endMs":468001,"text":"I bet if they gave him the rules in folk song lyrics, he'd remember them then."},{"startMs":469000,"endMs":471001,"text":"Oh, sure, sure. We'll have the sergeant send a memo to the captain."},{"startMs":472000,"endMs":473000,"text":"Subject, personal hygiene."},{"startMs":473001,"endMs":476000,"text":"How about having the manual rewritten in folk song..."},{"startMs":476000,"endMs":482000,"text":"Hey, wait a minute. Maybe we've got something there."},{"startMs":482001,"endMs":484000,"text":"Hey, the sergeant would think you were nuts."},{"startMs":484000,"endMs":485000,"text":"It would work with Homer."},{"startMs":485001,"endMs":489000,"text":"We could all get together and change the personal hygiene stuff to read in folk song lyrics."},{"startMs":489001,"endMs":491000,"text":"You wrote the songs for the camp show, Mike."},{"startMs":491001,"endMs":494001,"text":"Come on, Mike. How about giving out something for old Homer, huh?"},{"startMs":494001,"endMs":496001,"text":"Sure, sure, like, um..."},{"startMs":496001,"endMs":501001,"text":"If you brush your teeth and wash your socks, you'll never wind up with the medics and socks."},{"startMs":502000,"endMs":506000,"text":"No kidding, fellas, I think we can teach Homer personal hygiene with song lyrics."},{"startMs":509001,"endMs":516000,"text":"How's this? What are we going to do with a dirty soldier?"},{"startMs":516001,"endMs":518001,"text":"What are we going to do with a dirty soldier?"},{"startMs":519000,"endMs":523000,"text":"What are we going to do with a dirty soldier early in the morning?"},{"startMs":523000,"endMs":525001,"text":"Oh, my, howl! He rises."},{"startMs":525001,"endMs":527001,"text":"Oh, my, howl! He rises."},{"startMs":527001,"endMs":532000,"text":"Oh, my, howl! He rises early in the morning."},{"startMs":533001,"endMs":543000,"text":"Put him in a shower to wash all over."},{"startMs":543000,"endMs":545000,"text":"Put him in a shower to wash all over."},{"startMs":545000,"endMs":547000,"text":"Put him in a shower to wash all over."},{"startMs":547001,"endMs":549000,"text":"Early in the morning."},{"startMs":549001,"endMs":551001,"text":"Oh, my, now he rises."},{"startMs":551001,"endMs":553001,"text":"Oh, my, now he rises."},{"startMs":554000,"endMs":559001,"text":"Oh, my, now he rises."},{"startMs":561000,"endMs":565000,"text":"Without BO in the morning."},{"startMs":565001,"endMs":569001,"text":"Without BO in the morning."},{"startMs":571000,"endMs":572000,"text":"Ha ha ha ha!"},{"startMs":572000,"endMs":573000,"text":"Good stuff! Hey!"},{"startMs":573000,"endMs":576000,"text":"Hey, how about dreaming up something about soap and water for Homer for tomorrow morning?"},{"startMs":576001,"endMs":577000,"text":"Soap and water, eh?"},{"startMs":577000,"endMs":577001,"text":"Yeah."},{"startMs":578000,"endMs":578001,"text":"Let's see now."},{"startMs":583000,"endMs":584000,"text":"How about..."},{"startMs":584000,"endMs":589000,"text":"Oh, soap and water make you cleaner than you used to be..."},{"startMs":589000,"endMs":592000,"text":"Cleaner than you used to be? Cleaner than you used to be?"},{"startMs":592000,"endMs":600000,"text":"Soap and water make you cleaner than you used to be Keep you fresh and clean Keep you fresh and clean"},{"startMs":600000,"endMs":607001,"text":"Keep you fresh and clean Oh, soap and water make you cleaner than you used to be"},{"startMs":607001,"endMs":615001,"text":"Keep you fresh and clean Keep you fresh and clean Keep you fresh and clean"},{"startMs":615001,"endMs":626000,"text":"Soap and water make you cleaner than you used to be Keep you fresh and clean You know, Mike,"},{"startMs":626000,"endMs":627001,"text":"those are pretty good lyrics. Got any more?"},{"startMs":628000,"endMs":630000,"text":"Sure, but you've got to get in here with us."},{"startMs":630000,"endMs":633000,"text":"Yeah, those are shower lyrics, Homer. Come on in, the water's fine."},{"startMs":633000,"endMs":634000,"text":"Oh, no!"},{"startMs":634000,"endMs":634001,"text":"No! It's not enough!"},{"startMs":635001,"endMs":636001,"text":"Hey, hey, fellas!"},{"startMs":637000,"endMs":639000,"text":"Hey, hey!"},{"startMs":639000,"endMs":639001,"text":"[...] hey, hey!"},{"startMs":639001,"endMs":640001,"text":"Every time I..."},{"startMs":640001,"endMs":641001,"text":"Hey, hey, hey, hey!"},{"startMs":641001,"endMs":642001,"text":"Hey, fellas, get in here!"},{"startMs":643001,"endMs":651000,"text":"Oh, you smell sweet [...] are than you used to be Sweeter than you used to be Sweeter than you used to be You'll be neat"},{"startMs":651000,"endMs":658000,"text":"Yes, we are than you used to be When you get rid of the old When you get rid of the old"},{"startMs":658000,"endMs":670000,"text":"When you get rid of the old When you get rid of the old"},{"startMs":670000,"endMs":678000,"text":"When you get rid of the old When you get rid of the old If you brush your teeth, you'll always find"},{"startMs":678000,"endMs":685000,"text":"You'll have all your teeth to chew and grind You've got to brush your choppers all around"},{"startMs":685000,"endMs":694000,"text":"Not side to side, but up and down Brush them up and brush them down Keep your choppers clean and sound"},{"startMs":694000,"endMs":701001,"text":"Help your teeth to stay around Until you're old and gray Oh, you had no teeth in your infancy"},{"startMs":701001,"endMs":709001,"text":"And you'll still have none in the infantry If you don't take care of your teeth and gums"},{"startMs":709001,"endMs":718000,"text":"You'll wish you had when a toothache comes Brush them up and brush them down Keep your choppers clean and sound"},{"startMs":718000,"endMs":727000,"text":"Help your teeth to stay around Until you're old and gray Oh, brush them up and brush them down"},{"startMs":727000,"endMs":739000,"text":"Keep your choppers clean and sound Help your teeth to stay around Until you're old and gray"},{"startMs":739000,"endMs":746001,"text":"Homer's initiation to personal hygiene Is beginning to make a better soldier out of him"},{"startMs":746001,"endMs":754001,"text":"And may help him get back his class A pass And now he's starting the day off right"},{"startMs":754001,"endMs":763001,"text":"A bath and a tooth scrubbing Oh, yes, he'll wash his hair and scalp too And have his hair trim regularly"},{"startMs":763001,"endMs":773000,"text":"There's nothing like that well-drilled look To start the day off right Now he knows he shouldn't wear socks"},{"startMs":773000,"endMs":784001,"text":"With holes or large mens in them So he'll put on a fresh pair of clean socks"},{"startMs":784001,"endMs":792000,"text":"As Confucius said Man who do not change socks daily"},{"startMs":792000,"endMs":801000,"text":"Change friends daily It's healthier too No dirt, no germs, no sore and itchy feet"},{"startMs":801000,"endMs":809001,"text":"He also knows that his socks should fit him just right Large enough to allow his toes to move freely"},{"startMs":809001,"endMs":819000,"text":"But not too loose Or they'll wrinkle and cause blisters Shoes"},{"startMs":819000,"endMs":829000,"text":"are important also When your feet hurt, you hurt all over Are Homer's shoes too big?"},{"startMs":830000,"endMs":838000,"text":"If so, he's inviting trouble There should be no binding or undue pressure When his foot is expanded by body weight Hey Pat Yeah?"},{"startMs":838001,"endMs":845000,"text":"I think I got the new marching song down okay Good, let's go through it before ciao Hey fellas Here Pat Let's rehearse Homer's new marching song again"},{"startMs":845000,"endMs":853000,"text":"Good, good idea Give up, man Oh, when you go marching down the road"},{"startMs":853000,"endMs":861000,"text":"With a faux pack on, that's a heavy load Your feet'll never pain you, ache or swell If your socks are clean, if your shoes fit well"},{"startMs":861000,"endMs":868001,"text":"Listers on your feet, corns and other woes Calluses and bunions will bother careless jokes Your feet'll never smell mighty like a rose"},{"startMs":868001,"endMs":884001,"text":"If you wear clean socks, shoes will fit your toes Listers on your feet, corns and other woes"},{"startMs":884001,"endMs":892000,"text":"Calluses and bunions will bother careless jokes Your feet'll never smell mighty like a rose If you wear clean socks, shoes will fit your toes"},{"startMs":892000,"endMs":895000,"text":"Bum de diada, bum bum"}]}